      <div type="clause" n="4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{V} Gif swa ymb cyninges feorh sierwe, ðurh hine oððe ðurh wreccena feormunge oððe his manna, sie he his feores scyldig ⁊ ealles þæs ðe he age.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If someone plots against the king’s life, either by his own actions, or by the harboring of those who have been banished or of his men, let him be liable for his life and all that he owns.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If anyone plots against the life of the king, either on his own account, or by harbouring outlaws, or men belonging to [the king] himself, he shall forfeit his life and all he possesses.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">V. Gif swa ymb cyninges feorh syrwie, ðurh hine oððe ðurh wrecena feormunge oððe his manna, sy he his feores scyldig ⁊ ealles þæs ðe he age.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
